                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/968: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-07T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1919,
                                4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your August 4, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>There are no developments known to the Department making a change of policy
                    advisable at this time. You may repeat suggestion as outlined in Department’s
                    May 20, 6 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
